:name: stm32f746g-disco
:description: NuttX on the stm32f746g-disco. Console on sysbus.usart1, connected to the NTFC terminal.

using sysbus
mach create "stm32f746g-disco"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f7_discovery-bb.repl

$bin?=@nuttx

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset

connector Connect sysbus.usart1 ntfc
